{"path":"/industries/professional-services/","slug":"industries__professional-services","kind":"industry","title":"Professional Services Website Design | Legency Media","description":"Webflow, search and AI visibility for professional services firms: credentials where procurement looks, partner pages that win referrals, board-ready reports.","source":"live","stylesheets":["/_astro/professional-services.B0JDGFqB.css","/_astro/global.Btqt_PqA.css","/_astro/Base.D9X9tJbq.css","/_astro/ConsentBanner.Bjqg_HPr.css","/_astro/FaqSection.BU63QfoB.css","/_astro/ServiceLayout.DWPKQstD.css"],"scripts":["/_astro/Nav.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BTi8Y4C0.js","/_astro/Footer.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.QLgbxcz6.js","/_astro/ConsentBanner.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BlWZOVqD.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BUtqXeGZ.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_1_lang.s69FG7Vr.js"],"mainHtml":"<section class=\"svc-hero\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"svc-hero__tex\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/secondary-hero.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm></div><div class=\"container svc-hero__inner\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Industries</span><h1 class=\"svc-hero__title\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Professional Services</h1><p class=\"svc-hero__sub\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>A professional services firm is bought on reputation, and the website is read before anyone calls: a prospect&#39;s procurement team checks it, and a referred contact looks for the partner&#39;s name on it. We build sites that pass that reading, that a marketing team publishes on without a developer, and that report monthly in a form a managing partner forwards unedited.</p><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--blue\" href=\"/get-in-touch/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>Get in touch</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a></div></section><section class=\"section evo\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__head\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Where the Mandate Is Lost</span><h2 class=\"evo__heading\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Where a Firm&#39;s Website Loses the Mandate</h2></div><div class=\"evo__grid\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__col\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__colhead\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"evo__kicker\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Problem</span><span class=\"evo__coltitle\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Standard Agency</span></div><div class=\"evo__cards\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M12 3.25 4.75 6.1v5.4c0 4.2 2.9 7.6 7.25 9.25 4.35-1.65 7.25-5.05 7.25-9.25V6.1Z\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga></path><path d=\"m9 12.1 2.15 2.15L15.3 10.1\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga></path></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Credentials sit where a reviewer cannot find them</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>A prospect&#39;s procurement team opens the site before the first call, looking for accreditations, insurance, data handling and who is accountable. Held in a PDF or a footer, none of it is found, and what a reviewer cannot find is marked as missing.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M1 20V19C1 15.134 4.13401 12 8 12V12C11.866 12 15 15.134 15 19V20\"/><path d=\"M13 14V14C13 11.2386 15.2386 9 18 9V9C20.7614 9 23 11.2386 23 14V14.5\"/><path d=\"M8 12C10.2091 12 12 10.2091 12 8C12 5.79086 10.2091 4 8 4C5.79086 4 4 5.79086 4 8C4 10.2091 5.79086 12 8 12Z\"/><path d=\"M18 9C19.6569 9 21 7.65685 21 6C21 4.34315 19.6569 3 18 3C16.3431 3 15 4.34315 15 6C15 7.65685 16.3431 9 18 9Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Partner pages give a referral nothing to confirm</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Most professional services work arrives as a name passed on. The prospect searches that name and lands on a title and a headshot. With nothing about the matters handled, the sectors served or the writing published, the referral goes no further.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M5.21173 15.1113L2.52473 12.4243C2.29041 12.1899 2.29041 11.8101 2.52473 11.5757L5.21173 8.88873C5.44605 8.65442 5.82595 8.65442 6.06026 8.88873L8.74727 11.5757C8.98158 11.8101 8.98158 12.1899 8.74727 12.4243L6.06026 15.1113C5.82595 15.3456 5.44605 15.3456 5.21173 15.1113Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 21.475L8.88874 18.788C8.65443 18.5537 8.65443 18.1738 8.88874 17.9395L11.5757 15.2525C11.8101 15.0182 12.19 15.0182 12.4243 15.2525L15.1113 17.9395C15.3456 18.1738 15.3456 18.5537 15.1113 18.788L12.4243 21.475C12.19 21.7094 11.8101 21.7094 11.5757 21.475Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 8.7475L8.88874 6.06049C8.65443 5.82618 8.65443 5.44628 8.88874 5.21197L11.5757 2.52496C11.8101 2.29065 12.19 2.29065 12.4243 2.52496L15.1113 5.21197C15.3456 5.44628 15.3456 5.82618 15.1113 6.06049L12.4243 8.7475C12.19 8.98181 11.8101 8.98181 11.5757 8.7475Z\"/><path d=\"M17.9396 15.1113L15.2526 12.4243C15.0183 12.1899 15.0183 11.8101 15.2526 11.5757L17.9396 8.88873C18.174 8.65442 18.5539 8.65442 18.7882 8.88873L21.4752 11.5757C21.7095 11.8101 21.7095 12.1899 21.4752 12.4243L18.7882 15.1113C18.5539 15.3456 18.174 15.3456 17.9396 15.1113Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Each brand in the group fixes the same fault separately</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>A group with several brands or offices runs several sites, each with its own template and content library. A fix made on one never reaches the others, and when the board asks whether amends are being made across all the sites, nobody can answer per site.</p></article></div></div><div class=\"evo__col\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__colhead\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"evo__kicker\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Solution</span><span class=\"evo__coltitle evo__coltitle--brand\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><img src=\"/img/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"evo__logo\" width=\"57\" height=\"57\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Legency Approach</span></span></div><div class=\"evo__cards evo__cards--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm></div><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M8.5 11.5L11.5 14.5L16.5 9.5\"/><path d=\"M5 18L3.13036 4.91253C3.05646 4.39524 3.39389 3.91247 3.90398 3.79912L11.5661 2.09641C11.8519 2.03291 12.1481 2.03291 12.4339 2.09641L20.096 3.79912C20.6061 3.91247 20.9435 4.39524 20.8696 4.91252L19 18C18.9293 18.495 18.5 21.5 12 21.5C5.5 21.5 5.07071 18.495 5 18Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Credentials placed where procurement looks</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Accreditations, professional indemnity, data handling and the named people behind the work sit on a page that exists before anyone asks, placed where a reviewer goes first. The person sent to check finds what they were sent for, and the site says the firm can hold the engagement.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M14.2718 10.445L18 2M9.31612 10.6323L5 2M12.7615 10.0479L8.835 2M14.36 2L13.32 4.5M6 16C6 19.3137 8.68629 22 12 22C15.3137 22 18 19.3137 18 16C18 12.6863 15.3137 10 12 10C8.68629 10 6 12.6863 6 16Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Partner pages that carry the referral to a call</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Each partner and team page holds the matters handled, the sectors served, the writing published and a direct contact, built from components the marketing team fills in without a developer. A referred prospect confirms the name they were given and books the call from the page.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M5.21173 15.1113L2.52473 12.4243C2.29041 12.1899 2.29041 11.8101 2.52473 11.5757L5.21173 8.88873C5.44605 8.65442 5.82595 8.65442 6.06026 8.88873L8.74727 11.5757C8.98158 11.8101 8.98158 12.1899 8.74727 12.4243L6.06026 15.1113C5.82595 15.3456 5.44605 15.3456 5.21173 15.1113Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 21.475L8.88874 18.788C8.65443 18.5537 8.65443 18.1738 8.88874 17.9395L11.5757 15.2525C11.8101 15.0182 12.19 15.0182 12.4243 15.2525L15.1113 17.9395C15.3456 18.1738 15.3456 18.5537 15.1113 18.788L12.4243 21.475C12.19 21.7094 11.8101 21.7094 11.5757 21.475Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 8.7475L8.88874 6.06049C8.65443 5.82618 8.65443 5.44628 8.88874 5.21197L11.5757 2.52496C11.8101 2.29065 12.19 2.29065 12.4243 2.52496L15.1113 5.21197C15.3456 5.44628 15.3456 5.82618 15.1113 6.06049L12.4243 8.7475C12.19 8.98181 11.8101 8.98181 11.5757 8.7475Z\"/><path d=\"M17.9396 15.1113L15.2526 12.4243C15.0183 12.1899 15.0183 11.8101 15.2526 11.5757L17.9396 8.88873C18.174 8.65442 18.5539 8.65442 18.7882 8.88873L21.4752 11.5757C21.7095 11.8101 21.7095 12.1899 21.4752 12.4243L18.7882 15.1113C18.5539 15.3456 18.174 15.3456 17.9396 15.1113Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>One system across every brand in the group</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Builds, technical search work and AI visibility run across all sites as a single system with shared standards, so a fix lands on every brand at once. K2 Group&#39;s security team ran a 36-question due diligence questionnaire before that work began.</p></article></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section foundation\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div class=\"foundation__head\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Built for the Firm</span><h2 class=\"foundation__heading\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Four Things a Professional Services Engagement Delivers</h2></div></div><div class=\"foundation__grid\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M8.5 11.5L11.5 14.5L16.5 9.5\"/><path d=\"M5 18L3.13036 4.91253C3.05646 4.39524 3.39389 3.91247 3.90398 3.79912L11.5661 2.09641C11.8519 2.03291 12.1481 2.03291 12.4339 2.09641L20.096 3.79912C20.6061 3.91247 20.9435 4.39524 20.8696 4.91252L19 18C18.9293 18.495 18.5 21.5 12 21.5C5.5 21.5 5.07071 18.495 5 18Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Trust Signals a Reviewer Can Find</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Accreditations, insurance, data handling and named accountability on pages a prospect&#39;s procurement team reaches in one click, so the legitimacy check passes before the first call.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 12V5.74853C20 5.5894 19.9368 5.43679 19.8243 5.32426L16.6757 2.17574C16.5632 2.06321 16.4106 2 16.2515 2H4.6C4.26863 2 4 2.26863 4 2.6V21.4C4 21.7314 4.26863 22 4.6 22H11\"/><path d=\"M8 10H16M8 6H12M8 14H11\"/><path d=\"M17.9541 16.9394L18.9541 15.9394C19.392 15.5015 20.102 15.5015 20.5399 15.9394V15.9394C20.9778 16.3773 20.9778 17.0873 20.5399 17.5252L19.5399 18.5252M17.9541 16.9394L14.963 19.9305C14.8131 20.0804 14.7147 20.2741 14.6821 20.4835L14.4394 22.0399L15.9957 21.7973C16.2052 21.7646 16.3988 21.6662 16.5487 21.5163L19.5399 18.5252M17.9541 16.9394L19.5399 18.5252\"/><path d=\"M16 2V5.4C16 5.73137 16.2686 6 16.6 6H20\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Pages Your Team Publishes Without a Developer</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Partner profiles, practice pages and insights built from locked components, so the marketing team adds a new partner or a new office the day it is announced and the page matches the rest of the site.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M3 17.4V6.6C3 6.26863 3.26863 6 3.6 6H16.6789C16.8795 6 17.0668 6.10026 17.1781 6.26718L20.7781 11.6672C20.9125 11.8687 20.9125 12.1313 20.7781 12.3328L17.1781 17.7328C17.0668 17.8997 16.8795 18 16.6789 18H3.6C3.26863 18 3 17.7314 3 17.4Z\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>One System Across Brands and Languages</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Shared standards on every site in the group, locale variants with translated URLs, and per-office publishing rights, so each market finds its own page and a change made once reaches every brand.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M9 21H15M9 21V16M9 21H3.6C3.26863 21 3 20.7314 3 20.4V16.6C3 16.2686 3.26863 16 3.6 16H9M15 21V9M15 21H20.4C20.7314 21 21 20.7314 21 20.4V3.6C21 3.26863 20.7314 3 20.4 3H15.6C15.2686 3 15 3.26863 15 3.6V9M15 9H9.6C9.26863 9 9 9.26863 9 9.6V16\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>A Report the Board Reads Unedited</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>One report per site each month covering traffic, keywords, authority, AI visibility and work delivered, every number sourced, built to be forwarded to a managing partner or board without a briefing.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"section trust\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc><div class=\"container trust__inner\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc><div class=\"trust__head\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>Trust on the Page</span><h2 class=\"dp__heading\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>Procurement Reads the Site Before a Partner Calls</h2><p class=\"dp__sub\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>A professional services firm sells expertise and is bought on trust, so the website is read as evidence before the first conversation. Professional services website design starts from that reading: what a prospect's procurement team looks for, and what a referred contact needs to confirm.</p><p class=\"trust__order\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>Four pages, in the order a reviewer opens them.</p></div><ol class=\"trust__steps\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc><li class=\"trust__step\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc><span class=\"trust__num\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>01</span><div data-astro-cid-eqecahdc><h3 data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>Credentials on a page that exists first</h3><p data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>Accreditations, regulatory registrations, professional indemnity and data handling belong on a page that exists before anyone asks, linked from the places a reviewer opens first. Buried in a PDF or held back for the proposal, they do not help the person sent to check.</p></div></li><li class=\"trust__step\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc><span class=\"trust__num\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>02</span><div data-astro-cid-eqecahdc><h3 data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>Partner pages that hold the sale</h3><p data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>The partner's name is what the referral passes on, so the partner's page holds the matters handled, the sectors served, the writing published and a direct route to a call. Built from components, it is updated by the marketing team the day a partner joins or is promoted.</p></div></li><li class=\"trust__step\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc><span class=\"trust__num\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>03</span><div data-astro-cid-eqecahdc><h3 data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>Insights that read as expertise</h3><p data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>Published thinking is the second thing a prospect reads. Every article on K2 Group's six sites was read against one test: would somebody type the title into a search engine without ever having heard of the firm.</p><dl class=\"trust__flow\" aria-label=\"K2 Group article review\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc><div data-astro-cid-eqecahdc><dt data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>196</dt><dd data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>posts passed the mechanical test</dd></div><div data-astro-cid-eqecahdc><dt data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>53</dt><dd data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>survived the editorial one</dd></div><div data-astro-cid-eqecahdc><dt data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>205</dt><dd data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>new answers, each grounded in its article</dd></div></dl></div></li><li class=\"trust__step\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc><span class=\"trust__num\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>04</span><div data-astro-cid-eqecahdc><h3 data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>A change record the board can ask for</h3><p data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>Who published which page, in which language, and when, is recorded per site. A regional office publishes its own market without touching the group hub, and the group has the answer ready when someone asks who changed what.</p></div></li></ol></div></section><section class=\"section ans\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc><div class=\"container dp__head\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>Answers That Name Firms</span><h2 class=\"dp__heading\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>Buyers Ask an AI Assistant Which Firm to Shortlist</h2><p class=\"dp__sub\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>An HR director, a general counsel or a family office asks an assistant which firms handle a matter like theirs, and gets a shortlist. Coverage in those answers is measured per practice and per market, in the same monthly report as search.</p></div><div class=\"container ans__stats\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc><article class=\"ans__stat\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc><span class=\"ans__num\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>3 of 4</span><span class=\"ans__what\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>AI engines cite K2 for discreet executive moves</span><span class=\"ans__src\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>20 questions, 4 engines, 31 July 2026</span></article><article class=\"ans__stat\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc><span class=\"ans__num\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>80</span><span class=\"ans__what\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>answers in the first monthly baseline</span><span class=\"ans__src\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>Rerun every month, rival wins flagged</span></article><article class=\"ans__stat\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc><span class=\"ans__num\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>449</span><span class=\"ans__what\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>FAQ answers across the estate, from 244</span><span class=\"ans__src\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>75 in French, Spanish, Portuguese and Mandarin</span></article><article class=\"ans__stat\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc><span class=\"ans__num\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>103 to 3</span><span class=\"ans__what\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>ranked terms left on the retired domain</span><span class=\"ans__src\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>261 URLs mapped, 63 of 75 stale links repaired</span></article></div><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc><div class=\"ans__panel\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc><div class=\"ans__engines\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc><span class=\"label label--on-dark\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>Checked Every Month</span><h3 class=\"ans__panel-heading\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>Four engines, every practice, every market</h3><ul class=\"ans__marks\" aria-label=\"AI engines checked\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc><li data-astro-cid-eqecahdc><img src=\"/img/engines/chatgpt.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc> ChatGPT</li><li data-astro-cid-eqecahdc><img src=\"/img/engines/claude.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc> Claude</li><li data-astro-cid-eqecahdc><img src=\"/img/engines/perplexity.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc> Perplexity</li><li data-astro-cid-eqecahdc><img src=\"/img/engines/gemini.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc> Gemini</li></ul><p data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>Each brand, practice and market is checked for the questions its buyers ask, in search rankings and in AI answers. The board sees which practices are covered, which are missing, and which brand should own each answer. A firm with one office gets the same read.</p></div><div class=\"ans__how\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc><div class=\"ans__how-item\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc><h4 data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>Content written for the question a buyer types</h4><p data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>Answers are written for the question a buyer would type, each attached to the article it belongs to. That is how K2 Group's library grew from 244 to 449 answers.</p></div><div class=\"ans__how-item\" data-astro-cid-eqecahdc><h4 data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>The technical repair underneath</h4><p data-astro-cid-eqecahdc>Assistants and search engines read the same site, so the repair counts twice. Across K2 Group's estate, 230 markup errors were closed and the group's brand search moved to first place.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"caseband\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><div class=\"pixelated-scroll-transition\" data-pixelated-scroll-transition data-columns=\"24\" data-columns-tablet=\"18\" data-columns-mobile=\"10\" data-rows=\"8\" data-mode=\"reveal\" style=\"color:var(--bg)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"caseband__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></div><div class=\"container caseband__inner\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><div class=\"caseband__content\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><span class=\"label label--on-dark\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>Case Study</span><span class=\"caseband__chip\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><img src=\"/img/partners/k2-group.svg\" alt=\"K2 Group\" loading=\"lazy\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></span><h2 class=\"caseband__heading\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>Five brands and a group hub run as one firm.</h2><p class=\"caseband__text\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>K2 Group is a global mobility group with relocation, immigration, advisory and communications brands on six Webflow sites. One partner took ownership of the whole group: 261 stranded URLs mapped off a retired domain, an FAQ library grown from 244 to 449 answers with 75 of them in French, Spanish, Portuguese and Mandarin, and a monthly per-site report built to go straight to the board.</p><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--white\" href=\"/case-studies/k2-group/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>View Case Study</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a></div><div class=\"caseband__media\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><img src=\"/img/covers/case-k2-group.jpg\" alt=\"A harbour at night with moored boats, rendered as a blue pixel dither, captioned Six sites, one answer\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></div></div></section><section class=\"ctaband\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><div class=\"ctaband__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz></div><div class=\"container ctaband__inner\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><div class=\"ctaband__text\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><span class=\"label label--on-dark\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Start With the Check</span><h2 class=\"ctaband__heading\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Find Out What the Site Says Before the Call</h2><p class=\"ctaband__body\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>A site review reads the firm&#39;s site the way a prospect&#39;s procurement team and a referred contact read it, then names what is missing, which page it affects and who fixes it. A call to walk through what it covers for a firm of your shape.</p></div><div class=\"ctaband__side\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><ul class=\"ctaband__points\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Whether accreditations, insurance and data handling are findable from the pages a reviewer opens first</li><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Which partners and practices are visible in search and in AI assistant answers, and which are missing</li><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Technical health of every site in the group, including markup errors and links still pointing at retired domains</li><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>A per-site format a managing partner or board can read in one sitting</li></ul><div class=\"ctaband__actions\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--white\" href=\"/schedule/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>Book a Site Review</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a><a class=\"ctaband__quiet\" href=\"/aeo-agency/\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>How AI visibility is measured</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section faq\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__head\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Common Questions</span><h2 class=\"faq__heading\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Frequently Asked<br data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Questions</h2></div><div class=\"faq__list\" data-faq data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-0\" id=\"faq-btn-0\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Can one partner run several brands or offices on one system?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-0\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-0\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Yes. K2 Group runs six Webflow sites, a group hub plus five brands, and Legency owns the builds, technical search work and AI visibility across all of them as one system with shared standards. A fix made once reaches every brand, and one name answers the board when it asks whether amends are being made across all the sites.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-1\" id=\"faq-btn-1\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>How do you handle several languages across our offices?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-1\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Each language is set up as a locale variant of the same page, with translated URLs so a market finds its own version in search, and per-locale publishing so each office publishes its own language. Where a translation carries risk, the content stays in one language by decision. On K2 Group&#39;s estate, 75 new answers run in French, Spanish, Portuguese and Mandarin, and regulatory content on visa thresholds and tax treatment stayed in English deliberately.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-2\" id=\"faq-btn-2\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Can the managing partner or board get a report per brand?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-2\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Yes. The monthly report is built per site and covers traffic, keywords, authority, AI visibility and the technical work delivered. Every number names its source, and work delivered is kept separate from work expected, so a partner reads a brand&#39;s page without anyone translating it for them. K2 Group&#39;s report is built to go straight to the board.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-3\" id=\"faq-btn-3\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Our procurement team will need to vet you. What have you been through?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-3\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Before the K2 Group work began, the group&#39;s security team ran a 36-question cyber due diligence questionnaire, and the engagement runs under a client-side MSA. Security questionnaires, vendor onboarding and client-side paper are part of how an engagement starts, and the answers are ready before they are asked for.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-4\" id=\"faq-btn-4\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Is a single-office firm too small for this?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-4\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-4\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>No. A firm with one site and one language gets the same build: credentials placed where a reviewer looks and partner pages the marketing team publishes from components, with a monthly report in which every number names its source. The group work described on this page is the same system applied to more sites. What decides fit is whether the firm wins work on reputation and wants the website to hold up under that check.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-5\" id=\"faq-btn-5\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Do AI assistants actually name professional services firms?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-5\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-5\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>They do, and the answer is a shortlist. Twenty buyer questions went to ChatGPT, Perplexity, Gemini and Claude on 31 July 2026 with web search enabled, giving 80 answers and K2 Group&#39;s first baseline. Asked which providers handle executive and VIP moves discreetly, three of the four engines cited K2. The panel is rerun so the board sees the firm&#39;s position move over time.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section>","inlineStyles":[".transition {\n          display: none;\n        }",".pixelated-scroll-transition{z-index:10;pointer-events:none;position:absolute;inset:auto 0 0}[data-pixelated-scroll-panel]{flex-direction:row;width:100%;display:flex}[data-pixelated-scroll-column]{flex-direction:column;flex:1;justify-content:flex-end;align-items:stretch;min-width:0;display:flex}[data-pixelated-scroll-pixel]{aspect-ratio:1;backface-visibility:hidden;will-change:opacity;background-color:currentColor;width:100%}[data-pixelated-scroll-transition][data-mode=reveal]{inset:0 0 auto}@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.pixelated-scroll-transition{display:none}}\nhtml.lenis,html.lenis body{height:auto}.lenis:not(.lenis-autoToggle).lenis-stopped{overflo